  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w25.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w25.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決勝の前夜祭は、去年より一回り大きな祭りになった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "提灯と屋台と、あちこちで聞こえる明日の話。宴の輪を少し外れて、手帳を開いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日を、一度ぜんぶ並べておきたかった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "書き出すと、こうなる。相手は歴代王者選抜——四百年の優勝者の、全盛期の再現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "監督席には、あの室長が自ら座る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同時刻、街の反対側では滅亡ショーが開演する。勝てば、最後の赤線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.002d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.002d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "負ければ——それは、書かない。覚悟だけは、しておく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w25.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤線は、いま五本。五本目は、抜かない剣の一戦で引けた線だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "台本試合、常時稼働、胴元総取り、出口廃止、名入れ販売。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "壊すたび、街の空気が軽くなった条文たち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "残るは六つ目、「台帳による再演の強制」条文の無いそれに、明日、線を引く。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手帳を閉じて、夜風に当たりに歩いた。誰もいないはずの砂場に——灯りがひとつ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰かが、型の練習をしている。見たことのない、古い型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "まるで、教科書が動いているようだった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w25.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決勝の相手——歴代王者の再現体の、一人だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "開演を明日に控えた夜、たった一人で型を繰り返している。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣にうちの仲間が立っていた。何も言わず、二人でそれを見た。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "気づけば、声をかけていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「こんばんは」再現体はこちらを向いて、四百年前の優勝の口上を述べた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朗々と、場違いに。……こんばんは、は記録に無いらしい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "記録は、ぜんぶある。型も口上も、栄光の一部始終も。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも、今夜の夜風に何を思うかは、記録されていない。耳の奥が、じんとした。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「豪快で、少し下手な笑い方だった。……台帳に載っていないんだな」共に戦った者だけが知っている部分は、記録の外にあった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決めた。明日の決勝の意味が、今夜、はっきりした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日、勝つ。四百年の伝説たちを、資産じゃなく思い出に返す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日は、この街の憧れを、取り戻しに行く日だ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宴へ戻って、明日の話をひとつだけした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「決勝の朝、全員で朝ごはんを。まかないの、いつもの席で」二年目も、この約束から始める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w25.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いつも通りが続く約束だ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w25.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
